The `manage_notes` function iterates through the list of operations and performs the corresponding action on the notes list. If the operation is to add a new note, it appends the note content to the notes list. If the operation is to modify an existing note, it checks if the note ID exists in the notes list and updates the note content if it does. If the note ID does not exist, it prints an error message. Finally, it returns the updated notes list.
